    "answer": {
      "short": "$6p-16p^2$. Correct answer: D.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}E(X)&=(-1)p+0(2p)+1(1-3p)\\\\E(X)&=1-4p\\\\E(X^2)&=(-1)^2p+0^2(2p)+1^2(1-3p)\\\\E(X^2)&=1-2p\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=E(X^2)-(E(X))^2\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=1-2p-(1-4p)^2\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=1-2p-(1-8p+16p^2)\\\\\\operatorname{Var}(X)&=6p-16p^2\\end{align*}$$\nCorrect answer: D.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
